data: {"text":"1. That the applicant has been falsely implicated in FIR No. 124/2026 dated 15/03/2026, registered at Police"}

data: {"text":" Station Kotwali, under Sections 303 and 351 of the Bharatiya Nyaya Sanhita, 2023, and"}

data: {"text":" is presently languishing in judicial custody since his arrest on 16/03/2026.\n\n2. That the applicant submits that he has"}

data: {"text":" been falsely implicated in the aforesaid FIR solely due to a pre-existing land dispute between the applicant and the complainant. The said"}

data: {"text":" dispute pertains to agricultural land and has been the subject of civil litigation between"}

data: {"text":" the parties for a considerable period of time.\n\n3. That the applicant was not present at the time and place of the alleged incident and has cred"}

data: {"text":"ible witnesses who can establish his alibi beyond any shadow of doubt. The applicant was attending to his agricultural"}

data: {"text":" work at his farm, which is situated at a considerable distance from the alleged"}

data: {"text":" scene of occurrence, at the relevant time.\n\n4. That the case against"}

data: {"text":" the applicant is based entirely on false and concocted allegations made by the complainant with mal"}

data: {"text":"afide intentions to settle scores in the ongoing civil dispute. The complainant has deliberately supp"}

data: {"text":"ressed material facts and has presented a distorted version of events to implicate the applicant.\n\n5. That the applicant has"}

data: {"text":" deep roots in the society and has been residing at the same address"}

data: {"text":" for several decades. He owns agricultural land and immovable property in the locality"}

data: {"text":" and has no intention or inclination to flee from justice or ab"}

data: {"text":"scond from the legal proceedings.\n\n6. That the applicant is a law-abiding citizen with"}

data: {"text":" no previous criminal antecedents whatsoever. His conduct throughout his life has been exemplary and there"}

data: {"text":" is no material on record to suggest that he has ever been involved in any criminal activity or has any"}

data: {"text":" propensity to commit crimes.\n\n7. That the applicant has been fully cooperating with the investigation since the registration of the FIR and has never"}

data: {"text":" attempted to tamper with evidence or influence witnesses. He voluntarily appeared"}

data: {"text":" before the investigating officer whenever called upon and has extended complete cooperation in the investigation.\n\n8. That the continued"}

data: {"text":" detention of the applicant in judicial custody is a grave violation of his fundamental right to life and liberty as guaranteed under"}

data: {"text":" Article 21 of the Constitution of India, especially when the allegations against him are manifestly false and baseless.\n\n9. That the applic"}

data: {"text":"ant undertakes to abide by all conditions that this Hon'ble Court may deem fit to impose upon him and shall"}

data: {"text":" not misuse the liberty granted to him in any manner whatsoever. He further"}

data: {"text":" undertakes not to leave the jurisdiction of this Hon'ble Court without prior permission.\n\n10. That the present application is being filed b"}

data: {"text":"ona fide and in the interest of justice, and the applicant has no other efficacious remedy available except to approach"}

data: {"text":" this Hon'ble Court for the grant of regular bail in the peculiar facts and circumstances of the"}

data: {"text":" case."}

